|                                                              |                                                            | Function injection basics
*--------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------+
| {{{./springboot/SpringRestFunctionHttpServer/index.html}Function Injection}} | Compose a multi-step request pipeline via YAML. Conditional branching with @Flow, sequential continuation with return values, and typed data passing between steps. | @Flow\
|                                                              |                                                            | @Parameter\
|                                                              |                                                            | Pipeline composition
*--------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------+
| {{{./springboot/SpringRestExceptionHttpServer/index.html}Exception Handling}} | Handle exceptions thrown from REST service methods and map them to HTTP responses. | @ExceptionHandler\
|                                                              |                                                            | REST error handling
